msgid "GPS for Yaw (aka Moving Baseline)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:7
#: 146e8a5efff64abcbe5d56ad88b31192
msgid "New RTK GPS modules, such as a pair of Ublox F9's, devices based on the Unicore UM-982 or some dual-antenna devices can be used to estimate yaw, in addition to providing position information. This removes the need for a compass which may suffer from magnetic interference from the ground or the vehicle's motors and ESCs. This works even if the GPSs do not have an RTK fix (RTCM data from a fixed RTK station or NTRIP server)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:12
#: 9c2397414cc4415e89a64feaa7e5c1d1
msgid "GPSes from ArduPilot Partners that are known to work are shown on the :ref:`common-positioning-landing-page`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:16
#: 9afca620044b4091af167da2a206f1b9
msgid "**Ublox F9P modules must run firmware version 1.3.2 or higher and constellations configured**. See :ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:20
#: 8d7c5d9e760048d5a00cc7ec52f6a89b
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:22
#: 100094d4bbd14ee8a3fba61743c28900
msgid "GPS Yaw estimation relies on the detection of signal delays from each satellite as they reach two separated antennas. The GPS system may consist of dual or a single module, but two antennas are required in each case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:24
#: 08cb504da15f4ca0a43daab7d896f300
msgid "The antennas must be separated by at least 30cm on the vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:25
#: d769db1fed2840b7b9327eb89a5c7ad8
msgid "For dual unit systems, the 1st GPS and 2nd GPS should be connected to the serial/telem ports on the autopilot or via DroneCAN.  The following parameter instructions assume Serial3 and Serial4 are used for serial connecting GPSes but any serial port(s) should work as long as the first port using protocol 5 is connected to one of the GPS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:27
#: d442e1e3b01e40e78a83f2309174c6df
msgid "Dual unit Serial GPS modules must be connected to ArduPilot via their (not the autopilots's) UART1 connectors, DroneCAN modules via CAN , or interconnected per their manufacturer instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:30
#: f120fd11900d44058cf0e4c5c5ebdcf2
