#: d9c66043c2204d47a77c4e6955088d93
msgid "You may instead install a cross-over UART cable between the two UART2 connectors on the two GPS modules (Assuming they are serial rather than DroneCAN). If you do that then you can set :ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS <GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` = 1 which tells the u-blox GPS driver to configure the two GPS modules to send RTCMv2 data over UART2. On DroneCAN modules, a second CAN port is provided to allow this direct connection for RTCMv2 data. In that case, set :ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS <GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` = 8."
msgstr ""

